0.03  2026-07-01
  - Query the D1 REST .../raw endpoint instead of .../query. Results now use
    D1's columnar form (ordered columns + positional rows).
  - Preserve SELECT column order exactly (previously alphabetised).
  - Preserve duplicate column names from joins for array-based fetches
    (fetchrow_arrayref/fetchrow_array/fetchall_arrayref); colliding columns no
    longer need aliasing. Note: fetchrow_hashref still collapses duplicates by
    name, as with any DBI driver.

0.02  2026-06-10
  - Initial CPAN release